#: ../../source/templates_x.ai.md:16
msgid "1. Visual Theme & Atmosphere"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_x.ai.md:18
msgid ""
"xAI's website is a masterclass in dark-first, monospace-driven brutalist "
"minimalism -- a design system that feels like it was built by engineers "
"who understand that restraint is the ultimate form of sophistication. The"
" entire experience is anchored to an almost-black background (`#1f2228`) "
"with pure white text (`#ffffff`), creating a high-contrast, terminal-"
"inspired aesthetic that signals deep technical credibility. There are no "
"gradients, no decorative illustrations, no color accents competing for "
"attention. This is a site that communicates through absence."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_x.ai.md:20
msgid ""
"The typographic system is split between two carefully chosen typefaces. "
"`GeistMono` (Vercel's monospace font) handles display-level headlines at "
"an extraordinary 320px with weight 300, and also serves as the button "
"typeface in uppercase with tracked-out letter-spacing (1.4px). "
"`universalSans` handles all body and secondary heading text with a clean,"
" geometric sans-serif voice. The monospace-as-display-font choice is the "
"defining aesthetic decision -- it positions xAI not as a consumer product"
" but as infrastructure, as something built by people who live in "
"terminals."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_x.ai.md:22
msgid ""
"The spacing system operates on an 8px base grid with values concentrated "
"at the small end (4px, 8px, 24px, 48px), reflecting a dense, information-"
"focused layout philosophy. Border radius is minimal -- the site barely "
"rounds anything, maintaining sharp, architectural edges. There are no "
"decorative shadows, no gradients, no layered elevation. Depth is "
"communicated purely through contrast and whitespace."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_x.ai.md:24
msgid "**Key Characteristics:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_x.ai.md:25
msgid ""
"Pure dark theme: `#1f2228` background with `#ffffff` text -- no gray "
"middle ground"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_x.ai.md:26
msgid ""
"GeistMono at extreme display sizes (320px, weight 300) -- monospace as "
"luxury"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_x.ai.md:27
msgid ""
"Uppercase monospace buttons with 1.4px letter-spacing -- technical, "
"commanding"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_x.ai.md:28
msgid ""
"universalSans for body text at 16px/1.5 and headings at 30px/1.2 -- clean"
" contrast"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_x.ai.md:29
msgid "Zero decorative elements: no shadows, no gradients, no colored accents"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_x.ai.md:30
msgid "8px spacing grid with a sparse, deliberate scale"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_x.ai.md:31
msgid "Heroicons SVG icon system -- minimal, functional"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_x.ai.md:32
msgid "Tailwind CSS with arbitrary values -- utility-first engineering approach"
msgstr ""

